# LF everywhere, whatever a contributor's core.autocrlf says. The dashboard engine is
# copied into workspaces and compared byte-for-byte with release tags by upgrade and
# contribute; a CRLF checkout on Windows would make every file look edited.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
